  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7105004",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710500401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710500401": {
            "id": "710500401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about these mushrooms...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500402"
            ]
          },
          "710500402": {
            "id": "710500402",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "No wonder they say you're an experienced adventurer — You came back with new findings so soon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500403"
            ]
          },
          "710500403": {
            "id": "710500403",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Huh? Are you sure you found them here? How strange...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500404"
            ]
          },
          "710500404": {
            "id": "710500404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is it strange for mushrooms to grow underground?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500405"
            ]
          },
          "710500405": {
            "id": "710500405",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "That's not what I mean.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500406"
            ]
          },
          "710500406": {
            "id": "710500406",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "It's just that they look similar to an indigenous mushroom in Sumeru.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500407"
            ]
          },
          "710500407": {
            "id": "710500407",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "I can't be sure yet with what we've got here. If I have enough samples, I might be able to arrive at a conclusion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500408"
            ]
          },
          "710500408": {
            "id": "710500408",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Speaking of which... Since you found it, you must know where to get more. Could you lend a hand?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500409"
            ]
          },
          "710500409": {
            "id": "710500409",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Bring me enough mushrooms and I'll pay you handsomely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500410"
            ]
          },
          "710500410": {
            "id": "710500410",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, how many is enough?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500411"
            ]
          },
          "710500411": {
            "id": "710500411",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Mmm... Lemme think. Please bring me eight for starters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500412"
            ]
          },
          "710500412": {
            "id": "710500412",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Don't worry. So long as you bring them to me, I'll make sure to repay you in full!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7105002",
      "subQuestName": "Collect 8 shining mushrooms",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710500201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710500201": {
            "id": "710500201",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Have you got them all?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7105003",
      "subQuestName": "Bring the shining mushrooms back to Khedive for appraisal",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710500701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710500701": {
            "id": "710500701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here're the mushrooms you asked for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500702"
            ]
          },
          "710500702": {
            "id": "710500702",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "You have my thanks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500703"
            ]
          },
          "710500703": {
            "id": "710500703",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "With your help, my research is — what do they call it in Liyue? — \"as smooth as a cat soaring in the air.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500704"
            ]
          },
          "710500704": {
            "id": "710500704",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Like a winged tiger?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500705"
            ]
          },
          "710500705": {
            "id": "710500705",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Yes, like a winged tiger!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500706"
            ]
          },
          "710500706": {
            "id": "710500706",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "What happened to these fungi?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500707"
            ]
          },
          "710500707": {
            "id": "710500707",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "How strange. They look almost identical to an indigenous species in Sumeru save for the fluorescein. Why? Is it because they've evolved in the darkness?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500708"
            ]
          },
          "710500708": {
            "id": "710500708",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "But why does their look remain the same after the evolution?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500711"
            ]
          },
          "710500711": {
            "id": "710500711",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Hmm... Simply put, fungi evolve to adapt to their surrounding environment, but by the looks of it, this type of fungi is more suited to living in forest environments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500712"
            ]
          },
          "710500712": {
            "id": "710500712",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "That's why I'm so certain of their Sumeru origin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500713"
            ]
          },
          "710500713": {
            "id": "710500713",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, why do they glow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500714"
            ]
          },
          "710500714": {
            "id": "710500714",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Since they aren't an indigenous species of The Chasm, they didn't evolve to glow. Rather, the glowing is a result of some abnormal ecological phenomenon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500715"
            ]
          },
          "710500715": {
            "id": "710500715",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "It's probably because of the fragment that fell from the sky. After absorbing its energy..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}